WEBVTT

00:01:00.056 --> 00:01:03.309
Now, my organization,
WE ACT for Environmental Justice,

00:01:03.351 --> 00:01:08.314
works within a movement of hundreds
of environmental justice groups,

00:01:08.356 --> 00:01:09.732
here and abroad,

00:01:09.774 --> 00:01:14.946
to address the disproportionate impact
of pollution borne by our communities.

00:01:15.738 --> 00:01:18.908
So I'm talking
about environmental justice,

00:01:18.908 --> 00:01:22.578
which is a civil rights
and a human rights analysis

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:24.288
of environmental decision making,

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:27.250
with a focus on the permitting,

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:32.255
the permitting process that gives
polluters permission to pollute